  "short_description": "<p>Eco-friendly <strong data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1828\">woven rattan basket</strong> handmade in Vietnam, perfect for storage, decor, or gifts.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"615\"><strong data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"214\">Product Description</strong><br data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"217\" />Our <strong data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"252\">Vietnam Woven Rattan Basket</strong> is a perfect blend of traditional craftsmanship and modern functionality. Handwoven by skilled artisans in Vietnam, each basket is made from sustainably sourced natural rattan, known for its strength, flexibility, and timeless appeal. These baskets are ideal for home storage, display, or as decorative pieces, offering a rustic yet elegant touch to any space.</p>\n<p data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"911\">Produced in Vietnam’s traditional craft villages, this basket reflects generations of weaving expertise. By choosing our rattan baskets, you not only receive a high-quality product but also contribute to preserving cultural heritage and creating sustainable livelihoods for rural communities.</p>\n<p data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"931\"><strong data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"929\">Key Features</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"1222\">\n<li data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"976\">\n<p data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"976\">100% natural rattan, sustainably sourced</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1024\">\n<p data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1024\">Handmade by experienced Vietnamese artisans</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1067\">\n<p data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1067\">Durable, lightweight, and eco-friendly</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1124\">\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1124\">Suitable for storage, home decor, and gift packaging</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1164\">\n<p data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1164\">OEM/ODM &amp; bulk production available</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1222\">\n<p data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1222\">Manufacturer, supplier, and exporter based in Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1525\"><strong data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1249\">Contact for Wholesale</strong><br data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1252\" />We are a trusted <strong data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1342\">woven rattan basket manufacturer, supplier, and exporter from Vietnam</strong>, offering wholesale and customized production worldwide.<br data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1402\" />📧 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1435\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1438\" />📱 WhatsApp: +84-975810168<br data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1467\" />🌐 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"https://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1523\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></p>",
